{
  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception capabilities, separating action commitment from sensing. The specification encodes safe, coverage-oriented exploration: random_walk in clear, move_forward for short progress, and deterministic recovery via turns when obstacles are detected. Recovery states are one-shot and only return to exploration after path_clear. Full_rotate is reserved for repeated or ambiguous blockages. All transitions are deterministic, and uncontrollables are total in every state.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for motion and perception to reflect open-loop actuation and asynchronous sensing.",
    "Specification automaton enforces: (a) random_walk in clear, (b) move_forward for short progress, (c) deterministic turn recovery on obstacles, (d) no oscillation, (e) rapid return to exploration after recovery, (f) full_rotate only as last-resort."
  ],
